@startuml
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

class Player {
}

class CreateStationUI {
  + askToBuildStation()
  + showStationTypes()
  + requestInformation()
  + showConfirmation()
  + displaySuccess()
}

class CreateStationController {
  + getStationTypes()
  + getLocation()
  + getName()
  + getCentre()
  + createStation()
}

class Organization {
}

class StationTypeRepositories {
  + getStationType()
}

class StationTypeRepositoriesSingleton {
  + getStationTypeList()
}

class StationTypeCategoryRepository {
  + getStationTypeCategories()
}

class MapService {
  + requestCoordinates()
}

class LocationValidator {
  + validateXY()
}

class StationNamingService {
  + generateName()
}

class CityRegistry {
  + getNearestCity()
}

class StationGeometry {
  + calculateCenter()
}

class PositionValidator {
  + validateCenter()
}

class RailwayNetwork {
  + buildStation()
}

class BudgetManager {
  + verifyIfPossible()
}

' Relacionamentos
Player --> CreateStationUI : usa
CreateStationUI --> CreateStationController : comunica com
CreateStationController --> StationTypeRepositories : consulta
CreateStationController --> StationTypeRepositoriesSingleton : consulta
CreateStationController --> StationTypeCategoryRepository : consulta
CreateStationController --> MapService : obtém coordenadas
CreateStationController --> LocationValidator : valida local
CreateStationController --> StationNamingService : gera nome
CreateStationController --> CityRegistry : consulta cidades
CreateStationController --> StationGeometry : calcula centro
CreateStationController --> PositionValidator : valida posição
CreateStationController --> RailwayNetwork : constrói estação
CreateStationController --> BudgetManager : verifica orçamento
CreateStationController --> Organization : verifica permissões

Organization --> StationTypeRepositories : possui
Organization --> RailwayNetwork : possui
Organization --> BudgetManager : possui

StationTypeRepositoriesSingleton --> StationTypeRepositories : encapsula
StationTypeCategoryRepository --> StationTypeRepositories : agrega

RailwayNetwork --> StationGeometry : usa para construção
RailwayNetwork --> PositionValidator : valida posições

note right of CreateStationController::createStation
  1. Verifica orçamento
  2. Constrói estação
  3. Retorna resultado
end note

note bottom of StationTypeRepositories
  Padrão Repository para:
  - Tipos de estações
  - Categorias
  - Dados persistentes
end note

note left of RailwayNetwork
  Gerencia:
  - Rede ferroviária
  - Construção de estações
  - Conexões
end note
@enduml